{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00174",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.65,
      "end_seconds": 3.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "So, good afternoon. Have a seat and we'll begin."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 4.98,
      "end_seconds": 8.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "Thanks, doctor. It's been a long few days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.67,
      "end_seconds": 11.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "Is this your first time with this clinic?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.03,
      "end_seconds": 17.23,
      "duration_seconds": 5.2,
      "text": "Mm, first time with this one, yes. A friend recommended it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.27,
      "end_seconds": 20.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "How can I help you today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 21.46,
      "end_seconds": 26.44,
      "duration_seconds": 4.98,
      "text": "Mainly I've been wanting to stop smoking. That's why I came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 27.78,
      "end_seconds": 30.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "Have you had a smoker's cough in the mornings?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 31.92,
      "end_seconds": 33.21,
      "duration_seconds": 1.29,
      "text": "Yes, I have."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 34.23,
      "end_seconds": 36.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "I'll just check what's already recorded here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 36.9,
      "end_seconds": 37.64,
      "duration_seconds": 0.74,
      "text": "Please do."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 44.99,
      "end_seconds": 47.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting. What about weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 48.65,
      "end_seconds": 51.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "No, um, no weight loss."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 51.72,
      "end_seconds": 54.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "I see. Any low mood or alcohol problems?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 55.03,
      "end_seconds": 56.91,
      "duration_seconds": 1.88,
      "text": "Nothing like that, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 57.85,
      "end_seconds": 60.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.62,
      "text": "Okay, how's everything else at home otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 61.97,
      "end_seconds": 67.3,
      "duration_seconds": 5.33,
      "text": "Busy. Everyone's running in different directions at the moment, you know how it is."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 68.2,
      "end_seconds": 70.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.28,
      "text": "What medicines do you take regularly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 70.89,
      "end_seconds": 74.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "I'm on telmisartan, 40 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.05,
      "end_seconds": 78.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "Let me know if I'm going too fast."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.94,
      "end_seconds": 80.23,
      "duration_seconds": 1.29,
      "text": "No, you're fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 80.78,
      "end_seconds": 82.41,
      "duration_seconds": 1.63,
      "text": "Any operations in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 82.83,
      "end_seconds": 86.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "Yes, I had a knee arthroscopy, three years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 87.26,
      "end_seconds": 99.83,
      "duration_seconds": 12.57,
      "text": "Just so you know how the rest of the visit will go: I'll finish my notes, we'll agree on the plan, and the front desk will help with anything that needs booking. You shouldn't need to chase anything yourself."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 100.35,
      "end_seconds": 103.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "Good, I was wondering how this would go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.25,
      "end_seconds": 110.19,
      "duration_seconds": 5.94,
      "text": "Alright, moving on to your background, any past medical history? I'm asking so that we don't miss anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 110.91,
      "end_seconds": 123.34,
      "duration_seconds": 12.43,
      "text": "I've had high blood pressure for about ten years now. I just want to get back to normal, really. It's a relief to finally sit down and talk about it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 124.79,
      "end_seconds": 134.16,
      "duration_seconds": 9.37,
      "text": "Right, so that's your known high blood pressure. We'll keep that in mind today. Just to be sure I've got this right, the telmisartan, what dose was that again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.43,
      "end_seconds": 137.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "40 milligrams, like I said."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 138.83,
      "end_seconds": 142.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "Do you have any allergies to medicines, food, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 143.01,
      "end_seconds": 143.75,
      "duration_seconds": 0.74,
      "text": "No allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 147.9,
      "end_seconds": 163.15,
      "duration_seconds": 15.25,
      "text": "What I'm doing here is putting together three things: what you tell me, what I find when I examine you, and what the tests show. None of those alone is enough, which is why we sometimes need to wait for results before being certain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 163.85,
      "end_seconds": 165.82,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "I appreciate you explaining that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.33,
      "end_seconds": 168.29,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "I'll take a few measurements first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 177.36,
      "end_seconds": 178.65,
      "duration_seconds": 1.29,
      "text": "Just relax your arm..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 200.09,
      "end_seconds": 206.72,
      "duration_seconds": 6.63,
      "text": "Okay: oxygen saturation is 98 percent, blood pressure 112 over 75, pulse 78, temperature 36.7."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 207.64,
      "end_seconds": 208.8,
      "duration_seconds": 1.16,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 209.87,
      "end_seconds": 213.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "Alright, we'll put it in context in a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 214.33,
      "end_seconds": 217.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "Give me a second, I'm just scrolling back through your chart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 218.39,
      "end_seconds": 219.13,
      "duration_seconds": 0.74,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.94,
      "end_seconds": 228.34,
      "duration_seconds": 1.4,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 229.87,
      "end_seconds": 233.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.6,
      "text": "Alright, I'd like to examine you now. Please come over here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.61,
      "end_seconds": 236.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "Can you lie back for me?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 246.81,
      "end_seconds": 251.37,
      "duration_seconds": 4.56,
      "text": "Chest sounds clear, a bit of wheeze when you breathe out hard."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 254.55,
      "end_seconds": 260.87,
      "duration_seconds": 6.32,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit back up. Sorry, I'm just writing a few notes, bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 261.75,
      "end_seconds": 264.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "Uh, no problem, take your time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 266.2,
      "end_seconds": 274.69,
      "duration_seconds": 8.49,
      "text": "Okay, so my impression is this: This looks most like nicotine dependence. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 276.06,
      "end_seconds": 279.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "Right, is this going to go away?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 282.2,
      "end_seconds": 304.22,
      "duration_seconds": 22.02,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's nicotine dependence, and we'll know more once the breathing tests is back. It's quite normal to feel unsure at this point. People often expect an instant answer, but a good assessment usually has a few stages, and today is mainly about narrowing things down and making a sensible plan together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 305.34,
      "end_seconds": 307.13,
      "duration_seconds": 1.79,
      "text": "That's reassuring to hear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 307.44,
      "end_seconds": 315.03,
      "duration_seconds": 7.59,
      "text": "I'm going to order breathing tests, for smoker's cough. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 316.05,
      "end_seconds": 319.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "I can book that for Wednesday at 10 am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 320.44,
      "end_seconds": 322.06,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "Okay, I'll be there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 322.83,
      "end_seconds": 334.66,
      "duration_seconds": 11.83,
      "text": "I'd like you to take nicotine patches, 14 milligrams, once a day, for six weeks. That's for smoking cessation. It's a commonly used medicine and most people tolerate it well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 335.43,
      "end_seconds": 338.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "Alright, I'll pick it up today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 338.67,
      "end_seconds": 363.07,
      "duration_seconds": 24.4,
      "text": "Pick a quit date this month, and tell your family so they can back you up. Make sure you're drinking plenty of fluids, two to three litres a day if you can, and get proper rest. We'll refer you to the stop-smoking clinic. I want you to come back or go to emergency straight away if the symptoms get worse. Let's review you in two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 364.17,
      "end_seconds": 367.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "text": "Sure, I'll make the appointment on the way out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 369.07,
      "end_seconds": 373.93,
      "duration_seconds": 4.86,
      "text": "Can you run through the plan with me quickly, just to be certain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 375.36,
      "end_seconds": 379.96,
      "duration_seconds": 4.6,
      "text": "So, I come back in two weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 380.88,
      "end_seconds": 385.42,
      "duration_seconds": 4.54,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. We're all set. Don't leave without asking if something's unclear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 385.89,
      "end_seconds": 389.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "That's everything I wanted to ask. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 390.26,
      "end_seconds": 390.96,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Take care."
    }
  ]
}